---

 ⚠️ Security Notes

- Never commit API keys, webhook URLs, or credentials to this repository.
- Change all default passwords (TheHive `admin@thehive.local` / `secret`) before exposing anything publicly.
- Restrict access to the Wazuh, TheHive and Shuffle ports with a firewall.
